  ('cooked-food-better-hunger', 'Compared with the raw version, what usually restores more hunger?', 'Snowballs', 'Cooked food', 'Seeds', 'Wooden tools', 1, 'Cooking many foods makes them better for hunger recovery than eating them raw.', 42, false),
