  ('sneaking-prevents-edge-fall', 'While building high up, which movement action helps stop you from walking off an edge?', 'Swimming', 'Sneaking', 'Gliding', 'Sprinting', 1, 'Sneaking helps players move more carefully and avoid falling from edges while building.', 70, false),
