  ('mangrove-swamp-has-mud', 'Which biome is known for mangrove trees and lots of mud?', 'Frozen Ocean', 'Savanna', 'Badlands', 'Mangrove Swamp', 3, 'Mangrove swamps stand out with mangrove roots, frogs, and muddy ground.', 7, true),
  ('mineshaft-underground', 'Abandoned mineshafts are usually found in which kind of place?', 'On mushroom islands', 'Underground', 'Inside oceans', 'In the sky', 1, 'Mineshafts generate below the surface as underground structures.', 8, false),
  ('ocean-monument-guardians', 'Which ocean structure is home to guardians?', 'Igloo', 'Stronghold', 'Ocean Monument', 'Woodland Mansion', 2, 'Ocean monuments are underwater structures guarded by guardians and elder guardians.', 9, true),
  ('ocean-ruins-underwater', 'What structure is usually found underwater and often made of worn stone blocks?', 'Stronghold', 'Pillager Outpost', 'Ocean Ruins', 'Woodland Mansion', 2, 'Ocean ruins are underwater structures scattered through ocean regions.', 10, false),
  ('pillager-outpost-has-pillagers', 'What hostile structure is strongly associated with pillagers?', 'Jungle Temple', 'Trial Ruins', 'Ocean Monument', 'Pillager Outpost', 3, 'Pillager outposts are structures where pillagers commonly appear.', 11, false),
  ('shipwrecks-near-ocean', 'Which structure is commonly found in ocean areas?', 'Witch Hut', 'Shipwreck', 'Woodland Mansion', 'Nether Fortress', 1, 'Shipwrecks commonly generate in ocean-related areas.', 12, false),
  ('strongholds-underground', 'Where are strongholds usually found before players break into them?', 'Floating over oceans', 'On treetops', 'Inside villages', 'Underground', 3, 'Strongholds generate underground and are usually found by digging down after tracking them.', 13, false),
  ('warm-ocean-has-coral', 'Coral reefs are most strongly associated with which biome?', 'Frozen River', 'Warm Ocean', 'Deep Dark', 'Taiga', 1, 'Warm oceans are known for colorful coral reefs.', 14, false),
  ('witch-hut-swamp', 'Which biome is associated with witch huts?', 'Swamp', 'Badlands', 'Savanna', 'Beach', 0, 'Witch huts are swamp structures.', 15, false),
