  ('stonecutter-shapes-stone-builds', 'What workstation helps turn stone into many building shapes more directly?', 'Loom', 'Stonecutter', 'Composter', 'Cartography Table', 1, 'The stonecutter is used for many stone building variants without needing full crafting-table patterns.', 25, false),
