  ('blaze-drops-rods', 'Which mob drops the rods needed for brewing stands?', 'Magma Cube', 'Blaze', 'Endermite', 'Wither Skeleton', 1, 'Blazes drop blaze rods, an important ingredient for brewing and finding the End.', 36, true),
